{
  "info": {
    "name": "Cobre Notifications API",
    "description": "API self-service del sistema de notificaciones de Cobre. Incluye la obtención del token M2M de Cognito (que se guarda automáticamente) y los 8 endpoints: 3 de notificaciones (list, detail, replay) y 5 del CRUD de suscripciones. Todos los endpoints van autenticados con el token M2M en el header Authorization.\n\nUso: 1) rellena las variables de la colección (client_secret sobre todo). 2) ejecuta 'Auth - Get M2M Token' (guarda el access_token en una variable). 3) ejecuta cualquier endpoint.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "api_base_url",
      "value": "https://syudl6pwmj.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "cognito_token_url",
      "value": "https://cobre-notif-dev-auth.auth.us-east-1.amazoncognito.com/oauth2/token",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_id",
      "value": "487r8m30kv344g52t34occob55",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_secret",
      "value": "PEGA_AQUI_EL_CLIENT_SECRET",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "scope",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Opcional. Si el token requiere scope, ponlo aquí (ej. 'cobre-api/read'). Déjalo vacío si no aplica."
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Se rellena automáticamente al ejecutar 'Auth - Get M2M Token'."
    },
    {
      "key": "notification_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Id de una notificación (lo copias del resultado de 'List notifications')."
    },
    {
      "key": "subscription_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Id de una suscripción (lo copias del resultado de 'Create subscription' o 'List subscriptions')."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth - Get M2M Token",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// Guarda el access_token en la variable de colección para reusarlo.",
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
              "    console.log('Token guardado. Expira en', json.expires_in, 'segundos.');",
              "    pm.test('Token obtenido', function () {",
              "        pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string');",
              "    });",
              "} else {",
              "    pm.test('Fallo al obtener token', function () {",
              "        console.log('Respuesta:', pm.response.text());",
              "        pm.expect.fail('Cognito devolvió ' + pm.response.code);",
              "    });",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "auth": {
          "type": "basic",
          "basic": [
            { "key": "username", "value": "{{client_id}}", "type": "string" },
            { "key": "password", "value": "{{client_secret}}", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "scope", "value": "{{scope}}", "type": "text", "disabled": true }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{cognito_token_url}}",
          "host": ["{{cognito_token_url}}"]
        },
        "description": "Obtiene un token M2M de Cognito con el flujo client_credentials. Usa Basic Auth (client_id:client_secret). El script de test guarda el access_token automáticamente.\n\nSi Cognito responde pidiendo scope, habilita el campo 'scope' en el body (quita el disabled) y rellena la variable 'scope' de la colección."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Notifications",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List notifications",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/notification_events?status=&from=&to=&limit=50",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["notification_events"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "status", "value": "", "description": "COMPLETED | FAILED. Vacío = todos." },
                { "key": "from", "value": "", "description": "Fecha ISO-8601 desde (ej. 2026-08-01T00:00:00Z)." },
                { "key": "to", "value": "", "description": "Fecha ISO-8601 hasta." },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "50", "description": "Máx 100." },
                { "key": "cursor", "value": "", "description": "Cursor de paginación (de una respuesta previa).", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista las notificaciones del cliente (del token), con filtros opcionales por estado y rango de fecha. Devuelve solo datos del client_id del token (aislamiento A01). Como ya hay datos del delivery, debería devolver los COMPLETED/FAILED de C1."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get notification detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/notification_events/{{notification_id}}",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["notification_events", "{{notification_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Detalle de una notificación por su id. 404 si no existe o es de otro cliente (no revela existencia). Copia un notification_id del resultado de 'List notifications' a la variable notification_id."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Replay notification",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/notification_events/{{notification_id}}/replay",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["notification_events", "{{notification_id}}", "replay"]
            },
            "description": "Reintenta una notificación FAILED (la re-encola en la cola deliveries). 202 Accepted si se acepta. 409/422 si la notificación está COMPLETED (no se reintenta lo ya entregado). 404 si no existe o es de otro cliente. Usa un notification_id que esté en estado FAILED."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Subscriptions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create subscription",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Guarda el subscription_id devuelto para los siguientes requests.",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.subscription_id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('subscription_id', json.subscription_id);",
                  "        console.log('subscription_id guardado:', json.subscription_id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event_type\": \"payment.created\",\n  \"webhook_url\": \"https://webhook.site/595920e5-1f2d-4779-9b10-a6bc174f171b\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/subscriptions",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["subscriptions"]
            },
            "description": "Crea una suscripción bajo el client_id del token. Valida la webhook_url contra SSRF (debe ser https, no rangos privados, no 169.254.169.254). 400 si la URL es inválida. El client_id NO se envía en el body — sale del token. Guarda el subscription_id devuelto."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create subscription - SSRF blocked (test)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event_type\": \"payment.created\",\n  \"webhook_url\": \"http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/subscriptions",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["subscriptions"]
            },
            "description": "Prueba de seguridad SSRF: intenta registrar una URL que apunta al endpoint de metadata de AWS (169.254.169.254). DEBE ser rechazada con 400. Evidencia de la mitigación SSRF para el panel."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List subscriptions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/subscriptions",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["subscriptions"]
            },
            "description": "Lista las suscripciones del cliente (del token)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get subscription",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/subscriptions/{{subscription_id}}",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["subscriptions", "{{subscription_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene una suscripción por su id. 404 si no es del cliente o no existe. Nota: el edge.tf definía GET /subscriptions/{id} — si da 404 de ruta, confirma que la ruta exista en API Gateway."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update subscription",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"webhook_url\": \"https://webhook.site/595920e5-1f2d-4779-9b10-a6bc174f171b\",\n  \"active\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/subscriptions/{{subscription_id}}",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["subscriptions", "{{subscription_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Actualiza una suscripción (cambia la URL o el estado). Revalida la webhook_url contra SSRF. 404 si no es del cliente."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete (deactivate) subscription",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/subscriptions/{{subscription_id}}",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["subscriptions", "{{subscription_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Desactiva (soft-delete, active=false) una suscripción. No borra la fila. 404 si no es del cliente."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth - No token (401 test)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/notification_events",
          "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
          "path": ["notification_events"]
        },
        "description": "Prueba de seguridad A07: llama sin token. DEBE devolver 401. Evidencia de que el JWT authorizer protege los endpoints."
      }
    }
  ]
}
